The dataset in /data (flagged_employers/*.jsonl, scam_patterns/*.jsonl) is
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This means: you may use, share, and adapt this dataset, including
commercially, as long as you give appropriate credit and license any
derivative dataset under the same terms. The intent is specifically to stop
a closed commercial fork from taking the community-contributed data private
— any product built on top of a modified version of this dataset must keep
its version of the dataset open too.

Each individual record also carries its own `sources` field citing where
the underlying fact came from (an advisory, a publication, a community
report) — that attribution should be preserved wherever the data is reused.
